    "tier": 3,
    "factionId": "",
    "notes": "<p>A walking bastion of anti-thought: a hulking biped of cracked grey lead with no face at all, drawn to libraries, laboratories, and anyone with a good idea. Its dense body drinks sound and light, and its presence is a field of psychic static in which complex workings simply unravel. Fighting it feels like your own intellect being ground down to gravel.</p><p><strong>Qliphah:</strong> Ghagiel, the Obstructions — the Hull of Chokmah. The full stop at the end of insight.</p><p><em>Mal's note: 'It has never had an idea. It has ended thousands. Nature's perfect critic.'</em></p>",
